0..76 Comment "//! Abandoning the rest of a scope ends what it held without resuming it: an"
77..156 Comment "//! access abandoned before its `resume` writes nothing back, so its hold keeps"
157..234 Comment "//! the value it held. A handler clause that does not resume its continuation"
235..293 Comment "//! discards it [Plotkin-2013-handling_algebraic_effects]."
294..297 Comment "//!"
298..330 Comment "//! - see: #1334 — `unwritten`"
